{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1302,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1008b49f9e144d6e5136409",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぜい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29fdb8e596e65eecea53a3f7f0553f17146a9638d1b8dbef2651b576aff9bd55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d7e32b2e3e07a9888e5ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少废话，别跟我客气！\r\n我就是想接受严苛的训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b02357531fcfd5f288133083216ed1bb2bcac6e6ae8e06cfb80c7617751494f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88716d888311fe215d03c8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么训练内容，\r\n我都会迎着风潇洒完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "647c3d2fc0c2ae43af2ee6bf5382b6ac97f68beec1bf4227c3db5f73d10a7908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c35ae091b47b8faedf3b12f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在别人看不见的地方认真才潇洒……\r\n所以扎实地持续锻炼，\r\n也是江户之子该有的心态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c55b68bafa53dd68b2e068863edeb57b0fb413ae3fc300566cf73cb4f48d13d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c585fa11fdebac136f29724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有搭档真的很棒呢。\r\n只要有人陪在自己身边，\r\n不管什么辛苦都能忍受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ba4b2e641f4b57fa279fcc14da6bf3125a1ba621a245649eb6fd7fff2b4e48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f4099b7cb7d60b0a321e74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉只要跟大哥在一起，\r\n不管做什么都会很顺利。\r\n以后也要一起参加祭典喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab10ecf3e55b705a05b1a23b728c7d6ee6828a9e19abcc084e887f55913553b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2430acc33a925e328051fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一直保持潇洒也很不容易。\r\n不过只要大哥在身边看着我，\r\n我就不会松懈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe04ca537539c9a0c9b7da1b11c3fa2e9309627cd36f5701be202f32af9f5b95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ff6d2ff529b2dc5b217672",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经开始期待全力鼓起干劲训练，\r\n在浴室冲掉身上的海水和汗水了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e8a71d0addca5532e207eb1f1d54f488e7e0861b809cb2e645e115e60b5699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1374cc519bdf19155a9e805c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，出发吧！\r\n将这股燃烧的热情\r\n灌注于双腿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c6d35a891b57c2cf6d35df588f5235fd3b73e6b648c603ba0733ce4a22b30db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780989381b37f77412726269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服虽然看起来很宽松，\r\n但其实超级好活动的喔。就让大家\r\n见识见识韦驮天的利落身手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a02437737e7521173a85a6df42bde3cbadfde0ff72de803bb2f96a4d104d898",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cfb8e2fcc70bea4fb65fd30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我怎么一面潇洒地舞动袖子，\r\n一面华丽地完成所有训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f18f7ada9121818e3c04e761406b7ae5f0613d8dc3654cbbd680c156c4216da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d8ef464fe37654bbf40a05e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够一直平安健康地奔跑\r\n真是件值得感恩的事。\r\n得把这点铭记在心好好努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c9fbcb2b5904f7b328321384823ccd132d45de027c5e885b0d896c9063f9532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33771ec565872ff99fc0a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要肩负起所有比赛选手们\r\n难以计数的心意！\r\n绝不漏掉任何一个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ec9904a63f09091513b2f02b21187b5058f6f2a05f7674d31cc12ff57df575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc8bab978c6c8c592424bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将我跟你的意念\r\n都深深刻画进历史吧！\r\n绝不留下任何遗憾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "152220101cee98858cd6c610dc1cd5c59783878a30673b2e5453ff165405ddc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32141283b275b982c1850f24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "永远流传的转瞬光辉──\r\n就是我想跑出的表现！\r\n拜托你啦，大哥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5728563f821823514c5529e24a0a039b275646ab55be367a1db948001ffb1865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786939d1825d87e36eea940e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉只要跟大姐在一起，\r\n不管做什么都会很顺利。\r\n以后也要一起参加祭典喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb660c956d3a8bc2ad897aca89143387b26f4326f45ec9dda7bd6d3bb02a051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a38bac4a31713065df160e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一直保持潇洒也很不容易。\r\n不过只要大姐在身边看着我，\r\n我就不会松懈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dc1bc486811d431a7841ac74a9afdd10b7df2aa9c538269c92ec0b80cf4d752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba05eb589b7469b55f25b9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "永远流传的转瞬光辉──\r\n就是我想跑出的表现！\r\n拜托你啦，大姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c915a81ca2351c2ba9f617e76750c7bb283fcd1e8f6be3322a387b239b2c0a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2f4753e4f41f0c2c8639f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名伯乐这个词，和你真是太相配了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95b60ddf0a4899b61ed0190fca58a7176943a6beb0d94a90d5f0f2cba73c0df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11ea55b69cb3ca54718caaea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，你也挺潇洒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30845d09b89f82d4a57402cb4aa89822e15fd85051f1cad2d429a1434549945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b8da3d1819deec8288f65b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的心意成功响遍全天下了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dffbfef88a0155e918d848c40fb7bdedd49cfdb855b2d7cae48b59be9c73364f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e746c1968dab0809d1693c08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来是来自过去的祈求，\r\n实现了这份心愿啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff983f1b15d869f1955d2376490e2f1551f7e2997ecb4c8e7b83f8c5bcc84be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d14afaa8cec804252f370f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好看着我成长后的背影吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fc27e95d5b5f89e9ecd5514654e187d3bb02385e8e62ab5fd64e2cd7c5dbc4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba60b7361389c12bba01734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔！\r\n这就是所谓的脱胎换骨吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2d17f01032111bc09e89514cb532797f41aac71631a2557c395bad29739852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc464ad1f4b2854b48fa093b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是稻荷一！请多指教啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63db974874c0ad996352508caae9fc5f7c7250133455d321629b4c98b5708ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5188609012b33e896abb3d51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "潇洒又豪迈的江户之子！\r\n稻荷一，就是我啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e1f60f5676a353ca62cbc6181199ec77bf0bd04555453619aece79a8d6b1e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:401584c8d1e0fff3287bdd61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涌现满满的力量啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e949be74f98939378fd4ebc0a78d0b5c12244d65df1f4c74a7668640ae809f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b0815842a11152dec09f2e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我变得更强大了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91279217976d588822b0f5825e8e830a29e87504b3a138ca8b081b8c2903df67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e8688534624513fd4f86e50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让「此刻」更加闪耀吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1063b9de73180b20410978748cc97ffd6ae6e2e3de17f84b0edc081f3ce8e53e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f977a3f86c69d8c9530587b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要以成长后的模样\r\n背负起大家的意念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfceeea875d29bb8eb8173963da83cff95d4f4452751c16a6931c16a69be188f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02ca17f42f1081ff0dafe222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好瞧瞧我这甚至能抵达\r\n长久岁月尽头的潇洒跑姿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c811811f6e57dbef11f235543c97eb29272acd6fcd03732f3a8bacb3ed0fcf93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3188c6adeb614c2a3891b4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细看着稻荷一的跑姿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e1dc32fb4868705ae634232f102b8db56b9fccefa043d7300d4f0ecc56c7ee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df908eac4f883c00fe834234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲十足！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3cc5b5a9f023e2dd01c5f1ed22c7e5c6939912eede67de84d4fb3125ef888a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b876a05bef731d60d5a2f02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会泄气！也不会放弃的！\r\n因为我已经约定好要赢下德比了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "205fe4fdfa1797072e95ac46edcbf1bb5bcaeb10807b9b059e770300159b8579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7840ff1f22941884c81590da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきまーす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d78986101146d6de35ea8b61c365b98edb4995f82bc4377fc115f71846af476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27cae19b13e0c306e6ae45b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たっだいまー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "158f4ae1596b6a17787a69c6f252636900644d382934e99fee6ac009177ba091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b208c77a3c5e8bfd7ba4fea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对训练员的感谢\r\n是怎么说也说不够的！！\r\n谢谢你谢谢你谢谢你──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc1c42a0ab9bf5869a91ed29489ed378f4471d8a2c7808b090c69fc714fb29c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d85aba281959ea5eaf84928",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为训练员总会全力配合我，\r\n所以我才能尽情地奔跑！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e357bcc62e84054da6f50a49cd102ccbe1029998e3320c0cf9abf7ed0ea3d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b64c1c05fbca5974907de19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到大家寄来的贺年卡了！\r\n看来姐姐她们好像也过得很好……\r\n让我新年一早就得到了鼓励呢──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09ceb0530a503115e7f7409175b1b42e49fb43753eafe20a24323f2335395d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c282353bb659661eb010ebf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想做包饭的巧克力来表达谢意，\r\n结果却失败了……！所以只能给你\r\n普通的巧克力了，对不起！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86286c1c1ad4e1b32fb17d1604c656ce8a2ade00885894d10db6d72829cb491f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a6214a22f389e1549ed431e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了表示谢意及答谢你平时的照顾，\r\n我做了巧克力……唔啊啊，说出口\r\n好害羞……唔哦哦！别看我啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b050f1eeda02085cfadb5ee4c8d06dd2cd57c760242a1c6882410123783cb27a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b851fccc453dcbeb04d0e142",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……昨天晚上我做了\r\n100个晴天娃娃……但想要\r\n看到银河，这样是不是还不够──？",
      "source_fingerprint": "292d0f59ff2793dacd4ad4eaf159fc6fc1fcf370618716a031e42551ceef9795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97fbfd5f3a816eea2b9ee34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我根本不会恶作剧来着，\r\n结果还是收到了好多的点心！\r\n呜喔喔！大家人都好好喔──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5430788f77386348ee94e7b4370565085394cb2e4011b1b1e758b56f96b5a4be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b696c93c2dc27b3d2d88eed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐！嘿嘿，训练员也一起\r\n享受圣诞节嘛──！因为今天是\r\n大家都会收到幸福的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea0990394d89af268b0149035eda826f7e37d09f2482b8b911b8a29ee2540b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015feea748f039c472b678b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员如果当个乖孩子，\r\n圣诞老人就可能会来哦？\r\n别担心，我都已经准备好……啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85277387dc524df0968ec4fc517cf6ab7fa53c234d52e0cd5c2eee588f023e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e669513c391568aea6670b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功啦────！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b88f7bc1a4c63d69d6b5de0dbaf92be98b35d2b194117c1d9e4cea5c50f5311",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ca48ad37c59266145cbd4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人家说吃跨年荞麦面\r\n就会健康长寿诶！！\r\n好啊，我要努力吃一百碗！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57e1f452eccfe34c27d1355706eb5a25038cafda48f4daf5ac159a5a46bd796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1755c08f3b745bf908adbb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐──！\r\n从今以后！无论过多少年！\r\n我们都要一直一直～一起努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5c515c45799fbe82f19221b7a5ee49946fe3a8a57240515e55c5f9b2ec93e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:606177723e1f0f663e62f5fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经是大人的训练员\r\n也曾经是小孩子对吧？\r\n嘿嘿，有点想看你小时候的样子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4bd0f53c402f4e63d6193525382b34c80faba9458842b9fca977bfe80e8b70f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08f6df416df8c5ec18867d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日哦！\r\n要记住3・2・1……Go这样哦！\r\n我们的暗号是「Go」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe042f4407cb06730231f6e45d92ca051c5c53ef7d78e9e49b00b0ddd3fcaed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be56534ad8aa0b0125010e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，连训练员也帮我庆生……\r\n呜喔喔～！！\r\n我能生在这世上真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f411f42c7930764f5c28b104c9ba90d8ff9ea7674467477592e44f7d9806ef75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b52bad330e9e04770eae3e76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员、训练员！\r\n好像有什么新公告呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec65975c2bf402d6f74778d35fcb9a024c6747bc010f09cde55af9d47f5fa176",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2dfefa4aee20d291396bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂，好像说有礼物诶！\r\n可以让我来拆吗！？好不好！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02748cdfb911b9dfbe36e99222474617718e9401bc03e695c5021d83674f157",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a19f38b6f545678f9ddbdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！恭喜训练员达成目标──！\r\n万岁──万岁──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2aa68f7d6d320264cf6d64571efca0aac35cedb23b0ed3306175163bc78d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece5f8c17e73b51d0eb16fb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说正在准备要举办活动呢！\r\n嗯～好期待哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "054896111e425e260aaa606ef34ab418b2960ed1b2cceddef999a4b123f7833a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16cb700687c2e352a864e784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在办什么有趣的事情诶！\r\n我们也去看看嘛！快点快点！\r\n不赶快去的话，说不定要结束了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7543344e5fff0df8de49684d352571598e504e8d557c8c2465f8e4b8b44953f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad696d84c3ed397ef9898f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不甘心啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "548e6cf596214131995c2575986da3aa8a31feca3090453c1dbe829ccbe1c6b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11885d0f616d6d6b12d4e63d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级好像是提升了诶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ab890bdff8edbeee03c40bf1c80d41f0c3e31a73f172a9e579053bcbcd23aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c3814760d8dbcb06cf66d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服是我在常去的运动用品店\r\n买的！吸水性超强！！汗水跟泪水\r\n都会被吸掉，很干爽舒适喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5d03b837f915a4d4f1a0c05e56293b8f91a277260ec2ce0410c239a0a121da4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d1d23d2e48ccb53601e7d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨光和大进都好厉害！\r\n接二连三解开了逃脱游戏的谜题～！\r\n我？她们说我是「灵感专员」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb3ec5671eda08cbeb4b30f8491304dfc235343a879a20476a11e1443568f65a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bed0e2adc5ad01d1c996f074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前阵子我教小朋友们做伸展运动，\r\n结果混熟了！下个周末\r\n我还要跟他们一起玩喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae554f06efc88f28550cd0e5db08bbdbb9522ae9c803ff26e54da490d8dd280",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5450358c58fcd30eb0db6f00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我一定能赢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66f8dd1f1e85d316615822ff3f186122636d3a78689cdd62267b70499dd51080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5bf6f503a7b3cc6c705328d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我好开心哦哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb2920272c71a30e82381fb166d0698307d975f3ab1abf6e302c2a19f7bf9496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48b04cf90dcb1568f5eac2af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不甘心啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "548e6cf596214131995c2575986da3aa8a31feca3090453c1dbe829ccbe1c6b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
